    <!--
        NP_PARAMETER_MUST_BE_NONNULL_BUT_MARKED_AS_NULLABLE — DownloadServiceInterfaceImpl and
        FeedUpdateManagerImpl (net/download/service). Nine findings across seven methods, all one
        cause: J2K widened every unannotated Java abstract-method parameter on
        DownloadServiceInterface/FeedUpdateManager to Context?/FeedItem?/FeedMedia? when
        :net:download:service-interface was migrated to Kotlin (PR #21, d5b7f94aa), and each of these
        still-Java implementation methods dereferences its parameter unconditionally. Every one of
        these findings is a true statement about that inherited declaration, not a false positive.
        The declaration is deliberately left nullable per
        net/download/service-interface/README.md:10 — tightening it would relocate today's latent
        NullPointerException into a guaranteed Intrinsics.checkNotNullParameter crash at Java call
        sites that do not compile-break against a Kotlin nullability change.
        These suppressions are unconditional and permanent from SpotBugs's point of view. This
        detector performs no caller analysis, so it cannot observe whether any call-site guard named
        below exists. Removing a guard will not make the finding reappear and will not fail CI — the
        suppression keeps matching this unchanged implementation method while the crash path silently
        reopens. The guards are what make the code safe; this comment and
        net/download/service/README.md are the only record tying them to these suppressions, and code
        review is the only thing enforcing them.
    -->
    <!--
        context, item: no guard was added or needed — every current caller already passes a non-null
        value. context and item: DownloadActionButton.java:64,72,78 (an Activity `this` and a
        non-null loop element). The declaration remains inconsistent with the implementation, which
        is why this is a suppression and not a correction.
    -->
    <Match>
        <Class name="de.danoeh.antennapod.net.download.service.feed.DownloadServiceInterfaceImpl"/>
        <Method name="downloadNow" params="android.content.Context,de.danoeh.antennapod.model.feed.FeedItem,boolean" returns="void"/>
        <Bug pattern="NP_PARAMETER_MUST_BE_NONNULL_BUT_MARKED_AS_NULLABLE"/>
    </Match>
    <!--
